WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.560
All of us are at least 20 years old!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.740
So nice and warm!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.080
Hmm, let's see...

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.250
Oh! That's Michiru!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:24.920
Or maybe...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.420
Freezing cold hands attack!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.220
You made me press the button for something cold!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.180
S-sorry...

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.730
I'm back!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.480
Welcome home!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.480
What are you reading?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.730
A travel guide for Okinawa!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.150
The pictures alone warm me right up!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.570
I'm headed down to Okinawa with a colleague
during our New Year's break!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.370
Okinawa! Oh how warm it must be!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:28.120
Note: Naha Kokusai Dori is a famous shopping district in Okinawa.
Once we get there, we're going
to walk around Kokusai Dori.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.080
Then we'll have some soki soba.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.290
And then relax at the spa back at the resort...

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.130
Oh, it's going to be wonderful!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.630
I'm so jealous!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.930
We went together last summer, huh?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.140
We did!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.680
I still have pictures!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.020
So do I!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.770
Oh come on, erase those!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.150
This is from when Kae stepped on a sea cucumber.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.570
Okay, I'll delete this one if you just delete that one!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:55.400
I'm gonna send it to Michiru!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.650
No stop!
I'm gonna send it to Michiru!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.030
It was just the two of you that went?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.280
Yup! Kae just needed an escape from reality, see...

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.410
My heart is wrecked...

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.410
Yikes...

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.130
I'll go find my true love in Okinawa!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.920
The pork here in Okinawa is so good!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.550
They have purple yam desserts too!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.800
This is so fun, Kae!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.890
So fun indeed, Nao-chan!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.430
But what were we here for again?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.770
You know I could go for
some Okinawan food again for a change!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.730
Let's do Okinawan for dinner tonight!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.060
I love the enthusiasm but...

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.150
Most of the stuff needs to be boiled for hours, see...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.650
And I'm going to be having
the real thing pretty soon anyway.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.450
I'll hide away in your luggage then!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.120
Don't be silly, now.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.080
Why didn't you invite me...?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.080
Welcome! Welcome! We've got lots of great sales!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.420
Everyone else is on vacation and it's just not fair!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.340
I wanna go relax down in Okinawa!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.840
The following day.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.680
I'm home...

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.100
Welcome back.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.600
And the next day.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.350
I'm home...

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.850
W-welcome home...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.860
And the day after that.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.280
You really should sleep in your own bed!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.320
But then I'll end up oversleeping...

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.830
Then, this morning.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.740
I'm off then...

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.500
Michiru-chan, Makoto-chan.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.250
Yeah?
Yeah?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.750
I've got a favor to ask.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.760
I'm home...

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:46.640
I'm h... I'm here with great deals for everyone!

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.930
Hmm? Something smells great...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.520
Whoa! What the-?!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:59.770
This is the Shisa I bought in Okinawa with Kae
to leave by the door but never got around to it!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:04.900
Shisa! It's Shisa! It escaped from my closet
and made its way to the front door!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.540
Okinawan cuisine?!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.410
Wait! Why?!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.670
You wanted to go to Okinawa, right?

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:19.130
You're too busy for me to take you there.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.880
So I decided to bring some tasty
Okinawan food to you instead!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.920
You all did this?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.180
We did!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.040
We couldn't just watch you struggle by,

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.760
so we decided to throw an Okinawa theme end of the year party.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.810
Kae's the one you should really thank though.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.810
Oh, Kae thank you!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.940
Now, now, the food's getting cold!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.560
Well then, I'm just gonna...

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.320
Dress for the Okinawan occasion!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.320
Rafute!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.360
Note: Awamori is an Okinawan alcoholic beverage.
Pork boiled in Awamori!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.740
All fatty and soft...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.080
Look at it wiggle and...

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.710
Wiggle wiggle! Jiggle jiggle...!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.370
It's so soft, you don't even have to chew...

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.250
The fat just melts away...
Wiggle wiggle! Jiggle jiggle...!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.090
The meat just breaks apart!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.720
This brings back memories of when
Kae and I had some rafute together.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:11.600
In Okinawa they eat the whole pig
without wasting any parts!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.470
They eat up every last bit of blood and meat!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.390
They eat everything but the oink!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.020
Looks like you're all over that heartbreak, Kae!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:26.110
I bet all those bittersweet memories
would taste great slow boiled in a hot pot too!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.280
With you as the chef I bet so!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.070
Another beer, please!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.330
Me too!

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.500
Wait! Beer! I want a beer!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.750
Here's that very same beer!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.000
Orion Draft Beer!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.170
It's Okinawa's best known beer!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.500
Oh you're the besty-best!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.590
She's still sober, right?

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.140
The three star Okinawan beer!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.930
It's not Okinawa without it!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.680
It's so immensely refreshing!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.650
Such a clear, mild, and light taste!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:07.150
That refreshing light flavor brings back memories!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.740
We've got some good memories with this one!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.320
And it goes so well with Okinawan food!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:16.200
It's light and refreshing like any tropical beer should be!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.660
The perfect match for rafute
and any other fatty, heavy food!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:23.250
Come on, then! Stop standing around
and come eat with us!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.920
If this is a party, then let's party!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.760
Hard to believe the year's already over.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.800
It went by so fast, huh?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:34.600
It's already been half a year
since you moved in here, Michiru.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.060
When you put it that way it seems way too fast!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.310
Well here's to us all for working through the year!

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.230
To us!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.400
You sure have learned to drink since coming here!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.320
Well I mean, every night I come home from work is just...

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.160
Wooo! Michiru! It's time to drink!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.870
What?! Was I forcing you?!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.830
No, I don't mean that!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.130
It's great to have someone to drink with, even at home.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.840
Michiru!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.550
Let's drink! Tomorrow too! And the day after!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.220
I'm actually headed back home, tomorrow...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.840
Oh, is that so...?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.890
I managed to save up some money, so I'm flying back.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.850
I'm gonna ring in the new year
by just chatting with my mom...

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.100
Do anything fun for Christmas?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.350
Hmm? I just had work.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:29.690
Listen to your daughter!
She still hasn't found herself a man!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:33.030
With an only child like this,
are we ever going to see our grandkids?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.410
And then I imagine I'll start drinking away my despair...

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.950
Christmas is a day for working!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.750
It's just a normal weekday!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.120
So Kae's off for Okinawa.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.750
Michiru is heading back home,
Makoto's headed back home before I do too...

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.670
It's gonna be so lonely here.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.550
This is the last time we'll all be able
to drink together this year.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.510
So let's make sure we eat and drink plenty!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.180
Goya champuru!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.140
Probably the most recognizable Okinawan food.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:01.020
The bitter goya and the salty spam
will keep you coming back for more!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.730
This is the best end to the year!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.640
Keep up the good work tomorrow, too!

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:11.400
But hey, they don't sell Orion Beer
at the supermarket around here right?

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.280
Makoto went out of her way to find some for you.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.200
Kae-san!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.780
You did?!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.870
Th-they had it in the place
on the other side of the station.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.950
It wasn't really a big deal.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.290
Oh, Makoto I love you!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.330
Don't you go leaving me for any man!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.170
You want me to live my life alone?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.290
C'mon you've got me!
<i>Nao-san... It's good to see you back to normal.</i>

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.010
Kae, have fun in Okinawa, okay?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:37.180
Let's go together again next summer!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.760
Sounds great.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:41.390
Michiru-chan and Makoto-chan should join us!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.810
Can we?

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:43.680
I'd love to!

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:47.810
Alright then let's pray all of us can make it next year!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.690
And drink us some more!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.190
Cheers!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.320
Summer-time in Okinawa, huh...?

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:01.490
The slow tropical life... sounds fun!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.410
So warm and relaxing...

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.420
I overslept!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:20.260
I'm not gonna make my flight!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.930
<i>Unfortunately real life is not on Okinawan time...</i>

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.610
There are all sorts of different types of Orion beer.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:06.780
I'd love to try them all out
alongside some Okinawan food.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:11.870
The bitter taste of goya, the sweet fatty pork,
all washed down with some carbonated goodness!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.670
Here's to another night!
